{
  "id": "218201",
  "resourceId": 182,
  "name": "吉蘿婷：寒冬殺手",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c182_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c182_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "血液冷卻，\n你便能體會到冬日的來臨。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "勇士的身邊必然有優秀的隊友陪伴。\n朋友啊，你夠格當本勇士的隊友嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "片翼魔王。\n這傢伙一直妄圖將我吞噬。\n倘若真有那麼一天，\n你就和「冰玫瑰」一起\n摧毀我的肉身吧！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "曾經，我以為自己永遠也無法擺脫\n「孤獨」的殘酷命運，\n直到這場冒險結束。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "你問我的新衣服？\n這才配得上「冬天的勇士」，\n不是嗎？\n不、不過即便如此，\n你也不用看得那麼仔細……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "我是絕對不會被片翼魔王吞噬的。\n因為我身邊有你這個朋友，\n還有梅登。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "咳、咳呃。冷靜點，片翼魔王。\n現在不是你出面的時候！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "想要配得上從克洛伊那裡繼承過來的\n「平衡守護者」稱號，\n就必須行得正、坐得直。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "無線電塔。據說那是賢者的隱居之所。\n對這個世界的一切瞭若指掌的賢者——艾可希雅……！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "沒有「冬日詛咒」籠罩的世界是如此地安寧祥和啊！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "朋友啊，如果你遇見「碧眼的小夜叉」就召喚我吧！\n她是我的宿敵，也是我的競爭對手。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "勇士——吉蘿婷．梅菲斯特。\n遵循世界的意志，前來回應你的召喚！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，力量源源不絕！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "區區白冰龍，無論多少隻我都能輕鬆解決！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "既然已經確定好目標和地點了，\n那就朝著目標勇往直前吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀，哎呀。\n朋友啊，到頭來連你也對我產生興趣了嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "勇士是不會被任何誘惑動搖的。\n這個我就拒絕了……\n咳、咳呃！片翼魔王，不要擅自伸手接禮物！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "如果你以為我會喜歡這種東西的話……\n咳咳，那你似乎猜對了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "我向你發誓，\n我的劍永遠為你而出鞘。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "前世的緣分竟也延續到了這裡。\n朋友啊，看來我們是命中註定的關係啊！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "冒險就是要跟志同道合的同伴一起。\n哈哈，只要是和朋友你一起，我哪裡都能去！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，朋友啊，你指揮得了我嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "朋友啊，給我指示吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "命運在召喚我們！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，決一勝負吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "讓你見識見識勇士的天資。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "渾身的血液都沸騰起來了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "這些「組織」的傢伙，我要把你們掃除乾淨！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "冷靜點，片翼魔王！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "麻煩掩護我片刻。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "我保證很快就會回來。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "讓你見識一下最棒的結局吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "漫長的史詩劇是時候落幕了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "相信我所信任的你們吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "廢話少說。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "弱爆了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "成為祭品吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "呵啊……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "咳！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "啊呃……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "咳……果然是孤獨的命運啊……艾爾．泰勒馬．索盧斯……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼樣啊？朋友。\n參與我吉蘿婷．梅菲斯特的偉大冒險故事後，\n有什麼感想嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}